    "description": "<p>When an ally within your weapon's range is attacked by an adversary you can see that is also within range, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to make a weapon attack against that adversary as a <strong>Reaction</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"6657\" data-end=\"6684\">If you succeed, choose one:</p><ul data-start=\"6686\" data-end=\"6828\"><li data-section-id=\"1onuejd\" data-start=\"6686\" data-end=\"6743\"><p>The attack against your ally is made with disadvantage.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1fmep0t\" data-start=\"6744\" data-end=\"6792\"><p>The ally can move anywhere within Close range.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1gnom9a\" data-start=\"6793\" data-end=\"6828\"><p>The adversary becomes Vulnerable.</p></li></ul>",
